msgid ""
"Controls how event loop runtimes are shared among listeners. 'per_project' "
"(default): one runtime shared by all listeners in this project, balanced "
"resource usage. 'per_listener': each listener gets its own dedicated "
"runtime, highest isolation but uses more memory (one thread per listener). "
"'global': all projects share a single global runtime, lowest memory usage "
"but no isolation between projects."
msgstr ""
"控制事件循环运行时如何在监听器之间共享。'per_project'（默认）：所有该项目的监听器共享一个运行时，平衡资源使用。'per_listener'"
"：每个监听器拥有自己的专用运行时，隔离性最高，但会使用更多内存（每个监听器一个线程）。'global'：所有项目共享单个全局运行时，内存使用量最低，但项"
"目之间没有隔离。"

